1
00:00:18,120 --> 00:00:19,040
A man's coffin.

2
00:00:19,200 --> 00:00:20,560
A woman's wedding dress.

3
00:00:20,560 --> 00:00:21,960
What a delayed burial.

4
00:00:22,040 --> 00:00:23,720
Waiting to be buried
with his deceased wife.

5
00:00:23,720 --> 00:00:25,160
His fiancée.

6
00:00:25,600 --> 00:00:27,200
He couldn't marry her while alive,

7
00:00:27,200 --> 00:00:29,000
so her dress went into the coffin first.

8
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:30,600
What a pair of tragic lovers.

9
00:00:33,160 --> 00:00:33,960
Xiao Han!

10
00:00:34,520 --> 00:00:36,120
Xiao Han, what are you doing?

11
00:00:36,160 --> 00:00:38,520
I'm taking the points for this monster.

12
00:00:38,840 --> 00:00:40,400
Are you going to risk everyone's lives

13
00:00:40,400 --> 00:00:42,000
just for your points?

14
00:00:46,120 --> 00:00:49,580
If you don't want to die,
get over here and hold down both sides!

15
00:00:56,840 --> 00:00:58,840
Come a little closer, girl.

16
00:00:59,040 --> 00:01:01,300
Let's huddle together for warmth, okay?

17
00:01:10,560 --> 00:01:11,840
Hurry, stab it in!

18
00:01:12,240 --> 00:01:13,039
Okay!

19
00:01:26,200 --> 00:01:28,039
This thing isn't the target.

20
00:01:28,320 --> 00:01:29,760
The system's clearance task...

21
00:01:29,760 --> 00:01:32,600
That extremely yin object
must still be in this room.

22
00:01:32,600 --> 00:01:35,000
And it's planning to freeze us to death.

23
00:01:42,759 --> 00:01:44,400
How much is your worthless life worth?

24
00:01:44,400 --> 00:01:45,320
If I freeze to death,

25
00:01:45,320 --> 00:01:46,720
your whole family
won't be able to pay for it!

26
00:01:46,720 --> 00:01:48,240
Let go of me! Boss, you can't do this!

27
00:01:48,240 --> 00:01:49,770
Take it off and give it to me!

28
00:01:51,039 --> 00:01:52,800
Your filthy money is worse
than toilet paper here.

29
00:01:52,800 --> 00:01:53,920
If you dare reach out
your dirty paws again,

30
00:01:53,920 --> 00:01:55,000
I'll throw you out immediately.

31
00:01:55,000 --> 00:01:56,520
Okay, okay, let go first.

32
00:01:56,720 --> 00:01:58,400
Just you wait.

33
00:01:58,920 --> 00:02:00,180
What a waste of energy.

34
00:02:00,320 --> 00:02:02,360
Better than someone who won't
even waste a bit of energy

35
00:02:02,360 --> 00:02:04,360
and only cares about his own points.

36
00:02:08,639 --> 00:02:10,720
She looks very weak. Let me see.

37
00:02:14,200 --> 00:02:15,040
No pulse.

38
00:02:15,240 --> 00:02:17,120
Algor mortis accompanied by rigor mortis.

39
00:02:17,120 --> 00:02:18,600
She's been dead for at least two hours.

40
00:02:18,600 --> 00:02:20,800
Bullshit! Why are you cursing her?

41
00:02:26,800 --> 00:02:28,460
You didn't wait for it either.

42
00:02:28,800 --> 00:02:31,000
It's fine, me too.

43
00:02:34,560 --> 00:02:35,400
Honey.

44
00:02:36,800 --> 00:02:38,520
I'm so cold.

45
00:02:39,600 --> 00:02:41,160
Look, she moved!

46
00:02:41,200 --> 00:02:42,000
She spoke!

47
00:02:47,520 --> 00:02:49,360
Huang Kai, let go! Don't touch her!

48
00:02:49,360 --> 00:02:50,320
Every time you touch her,

49
00:02:50,320 --> 00:02:51,520
her zombification speeds up.

50
00:02:51,520 --> 00:02:52,600
If you keep holding her,

51
00:02:52,600 --> 00:02:55,329
you'll personally hold her
as she turns to ashes.

52
00:03:00,200 --> 00:03:02,840
Honey, I'm so cold.

53
00:03:07,800 --> 00:03:08,600
Foolish.

54
00:03:15,840 --> 00:03:16,640
Honey.

55
00:03:17,920 --> 00:03:19,200
Look at me.

56
00:03:20,200 --> 00:03:21,320
I know you haven't enjoyed
a single day of happiness

57
00:03:21,320 --> 00:03:23,560
in the 40 years you've been with me.

58
00:03:23,800 --> 00:03:26,840
Direct all your hatred
and resentment at me.

59
00:03:28,960 --> 00:03:31,520
Your self-righteousness
will not only kill everyone,

60
00:03:31,520 --> 00:03:33,980
but also leave her
without an intact corpse.

61
00:04:32,960 --> 00:04:34,620
This fire can't burn it at all.

62
00:04:34,840 --> 00:04:37,100
It's not the extremely yin object at all.

63
00:04:41,400 --> 00:04:43,760
Old Huang, I told the Bodhisattva

64
00:04:43,760 --> 00:04:45,200
that I hope we can

65
00:04:45,200 --> 00:04:47,040
buy a small house by the sea
in the future.

66
00:04:47,040 --> 00:04:48,600
Watching the sunrise and sunset,

67
00:04:48,600 --> 00:04:50,200
living comfortably.

68
00:04:50,720 --> 00:04:53,520
Okay, I will definitely
give you a good life.

69
00:05:34,000 --> 00:05:35,400
You always made me wait.

70
00:05:35,760 --> 00:05:37,360
I waited until you retired.

71
00:05:37,800 --> 00:05:39,240
Waited until you were free.

72
00:05:39,240 --> 00:05:40,640
Waited until you got old.

73
00:05:40,640 --> 00:05:42,600
Now you finally have time.

74
00:05:42,960 --> 00:05:44,000
But I'm already dead.

75
00:05:44,000 --> 00:05:45,000
Honey,

76
00:05:45,159 --> 00:05:47,040
I-I thought we still had time.

77
00:05:51,040 --> 00:05:52,970
Don't let her touch that talisman!

78
00:05:53,000 --> 00:05:54,520
Old Huang, burn it!

79
00:05:56,400 --> 00:05:57,200
Honey,

80
00:05:57,440 --> 00:05:58,800
don't leave me.

81
00:05:59,000 --> 00:06:00,400
Take me home.

82
00:06:06,000 --> 00:06:07,840
Forty years of obsession
turned her into a vengeful spirit.

83
00:06:07,840 --> 00:06:09,370
Burn that talisman, quick!

84
00:06:12,960 --> 00:06:13,760
Liu Yiyang!

85
00:06:28,600 --> 00:06:32,000
Burn that empty promise and let her go.

86
00:06:56,360 --> 00:06:57,960
The woman in the coffin

87
00:06:59,640 --> 00:07:01,700
waited for Master Ren her whole life.

88
00:07:02,240 --> 00:07:07,400
She was waiting for
the same thing Qin Xue was.

89
00:07:32,200 --> 00:07:34,800
Old man, I'm leaving first.

90
00:07:36,240 --> 00:07:37,920
There are leftovers in the fridge.

91
00:07:37,920 --> 00:07:39,440
Remember to heat them up.

92
00:07:58,600 --> 00:08:00,600
The extreme Yin obsession object
has been destroyed.

93
00:08:00,600 --> 00:08:04,930
Congratulations to the surviving players
for clearing the Nether Mortuary.

94
00:08:26,320 --> 00:08:28,080
We made it out.

95
00:08:28,320 --> 00:08:29,680
We really survived.

96
00:08:29,680 --> 00:08:30,880
We're back in reality.
